    "http://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@value": "\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tBill Brennan and Andrea Koziol Live at English Harbour AC\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tAugust 28, 2026\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tEnglish Harbour, NL, Canada\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tEnglish Harbour Arts Centre\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\tView All Gigs\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\tTime\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFriday @ 7:30 PM\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\tVenue Details\n\n\t\n\n\tGet Directions\n\n\t\n\t\tAddress\n\t\t\n\t\t\tChurch Road, English Harbour NL A0C 2H0, Canada\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tenglishharbourartsassociation.com\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n"
